~ arrival
Grandpa: Hey Sarah! Over here!
=> END

~ start
Grandpa: There you are! Last time you visited, you were knee-high.
Sarah: Hi, Grandpa. Wow, it's so quiet here.
Grandpa: Yeah... we haven't had many visitors lately.
Sarah: It's also so dark in here... what happened?
Grandpa: Oh, that's just the old generator. Here, let's go turn it on.
=> END

~ at_mill
Sarah: Wait a minute, is that the old cider mill? It looks so sad and abandoned.
Grandpa: That's why I wrote you. My back isn't what it used to be, and I could use your help turning on the generator at the end of the hall.
Sarah: I got you, Grandpa!
Grandpa: Just beware of the floating scarecrows. They like to hang out in the dark.
Sarah: Wait, what-
=> END
